  unitName: God Sotnarg (EU)
  unitId: 730135
  unitNumber: 7050
  description: "After years fighting the great evil sagraV, Sotnarg is one of the
    few heroes of the mirror world still alive to witness the summoners\u2019 victory.
    He grasped an explanation about his past nightmares. Apparently there will be
    an evil version of himself in those summoners\u2019 world?! God Sotnarg feel
    that he needs to meet the guy, Fist to Fist."
  summonDesc: Is this a new world? Or is nightmares? Caught in a mirror world. No
    escape from reality!
  fusionDesc: My armies! More soldiers! More Strength!
  evoDesc: My nightmares are not ending but as long as you're here we'll be fine.
